        3,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Covington%2C_Washington",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Covington became an official municipality on August 31, 1997, after a vote passed on November 6, 1996.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
